{
  "_id": "bd-uzziah",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Strength of the Lord. Called Azariah (2 Kgs. 14:21); king of Judah (2 Chr. 26:1); builds Elath (2 Kgs. 14:22; 2 Chr. 26:2); influenced by Zechariah (2 Chr. 26:5); defeats the Philistines (26:6); fortifies Jerusalem (26:9); smitten with leprosy (2 Kgs. 15:5; 2 Chr. 26:19); earthquake in his reign (Isa. 6:1; Amos 1:1; Zech. 14:5); called Ozias (Matt. 1:8).",
